# How to Add a Blog Post

This guide explains how to add new blog posts to the AVJ blog system.

## Quick Start

1. Create a new `.mdx` file in `content/blogs/`
2. Add proper frontmatter with required fields
3. Write your content in Markdown
4. Restart the dev server
5. Your blog will appear at `/blogs`

## File Structure

```
content/
└── blogs/
    ├── your-blog-post-slug.mdx
    ├── another-post.mdx
    └── existing-posts.mdx
```

## File Naming

- Use kebab-case (lowercase with dashes)
- Keep names descriptive but concise
- Examples: `remote-work-tips.mdx`, `freelancing-guide.mdx`

## Frontmatter Template

Copy this template for new blog posts:

```mdx
---
title: "Your Blog Post Title"
excerpt: "A brief description of your blog post that appears in listings and meta descriptions."
author: "author-key"
publishedAt: "2024-12-25"
updatedAt: "2024-12-25"
tags: ["Tag1", "Tag2", "Tag3"]
featured: false
status: "published"
readTime: 5
coverImage: "/images/blog/your-image.jpg"
seo:
  metaTitle: "SEO Title - Include Keywords | AVJ"
  metaDescription: "SEO description with keywords for search engines."
  keywords: ["keyword1", "keyword2", "keyword3"]
---

# Your Blog Post Title

Your blog content starts here...
```

## Required Fields

| Field | Type | Description | Example |
|-------|------|-------------|---------|
| `title` | string | Blog post title | "Getting Started with Remote Work" |
| `excerpt` | string | Short description (150-200 chars) | "Essential tips for remote work success" |
| `author` | string | Author key from config | "sarah-chen" |
| `publishedAt` | string | Publication date (YYYY-MM-DD) | "2024-12-25" |
| `tags` | array | Category tags | ["Remote Work", "Tips"] |
| `status` | string | Publication status | "published" or "draft" |
| `readTime` | number | Reading time in minutes | 5 |
| `coverImage` | string | Cover image path | "/images/blog/cover.jpg" |

## Optional Fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `updatedAt` | string | Last update date |
| `featured` | boolean | Show in featured section |
| `seo.metaTitle` | string | Custom SEO title |
| `seo.metaDescription` | string | Custom SEO description |
| `seo.keywords` | array | SEO keywords |

## Available Authors

Use these author keys in the `author` field:

- `"avj-team"` - AVJ Team (default)
- `"sarah-chen"` - Sarah Chen (Remote Work Specialist)
- `"mike-rodriguez"` - Mike Rodriguez (Career Coach)
- `"emma-thompson"` - Emma Thompson (HR Technology Expert)

## Writing Content

### Headings

```markdown
# H1 - Main Title (auto-generated from frontmatter)
## H2 - Major Sections
### H3 - Subsections
#### H4 - Minor Sections
```

### Text Formatting

```markdown
**Bold text**
*Italic text*
`Inline code`
[Link text](https://example.com)
```

### Lists

```markdown
- Unordered list item
- Another item

1. Ordered list item
2. Another item
```

### Code Blocks

```markdown
```javascript
function example() {
  return "Hello World";
}
```
```

### Blockquotes

```markdown
> This is a blockquote for important information or quotes.
```

### Images

```markdown
![Alt text](/images/blog/image-name.jpg)
```

## Image Requirements

### Cover Images
- **Size**: 800x400px recommended
- **Format**: JPG or PNG
- **Location**: `/public/images/blog/`
- **Naming**: Use descriptive names matching your post

### Content Images
- **Size**: 600-800px wide recommended
- **Format**: JPG, PNG, or WebP
- **Location**: `/public/images/blog/`

## Tags Guidelines

### Available Tags
Use consistent tags from this list:

- Remote Work
- Career Advice
- Job Search
- Productivity
- Work-Life Balance
- Technology
- Interviews
- Freelancing
- Digital Nomad
- Team Management
- Skills Development
- Industry Insights

### Tag Rules
- Use 2-4 tags per post
- Keep tags relevant to content
- Use existing tags when possible
- Capitalize each word

## SEO Best Practices

### Meta Title
- 50-60 characters
- Include main keyword
- End with "| AVJ" for branding

### Meta Description
- 150-160 characters
- Include target keywords
- Make it compelling for clicks

### Keywords
- 3-5 relevant keywords
- Include in meta title and description
- Use naturally in content

## Publishing Workflow

### 1. Draft Creation
```mdx
status: "draft"
```

### 2. Review Process
- Check content for accuracy
- Verify all links work
- Ensure proper formatting
- Test on dev server

### 3. Publishing
```mdx
status: "published"
publishedAt: "2024-12-25"
```

### 4. Updates
```mdx
updatedAt: "2024-12-26"
```

## Featured Posts

To feature a post on the homepage:

```mdx
featured: true
```

**Guidelines:**
- Limit 2-3 featured posts
- Choose high-quality, evergreen content
- Update featured posts regularly

